#ASSERT `s 117.0104(3) the date fixed for the hearing is before the end of the period of the order` (Date 9 3 2026) (Date 10 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- the day before the period ends
#ASSERT `s 117.0104(3) the date fixed for the hearing is before the end of the period of the order` (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 10 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- on the day the period ends is not "before" it
#ASSERT `s 117.0104(3) the date fixed for the hearing is before the end of the period of the order` (Date 11 3 2026) (Date 10 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE

